## RED run (c) — S-6: the published predicate removed from the engine

Break: `AND s.status = 'published'` deleted from the shared WHERE in lib/search-sections.ts.

    × S-6 … → a staged work must not surface in cross-corpus: expected [ { …(10) } ] to deeply equal []
    Tests  1 failed | 2 passed (3)

(The S-6 precondition — owner-side proof that the seeded rows EXIST with the token and the
